# Gravewell Shaft (CIPlay gravewell_shaft): 45 m down; the rim, the permit, Pump Ridge's foot and top, the keeper's note
# and chest (the cage's fuse; 10-25 deep pass), the cage elevator to the pit floor, gallery 1 (anglers, the logbook),
# gallery 2 (the pump key), the pump hall, the smelter store's three plans, Halvard's log 7.
island Gravewell Shaft
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Gravewell
zone rim
expect step 1
read Shaft entry permit
expect step 2
use cage
expect story cagedown 0
zone ridgefoot
expect step 3
zone ridgetop
expect step 4
read Pump keeper Karin
expect step 5
open Pump keeper's chest
wait 3
expect story cagefuse 1
expect step 6
use cage
expect story cagedown 1
expect step 7
air gallery_1
expect step 8
zone shaft
kill Angler fish
expect step 9
read Gallery logbook
expect step 10
air gallery_2
open Gallery crate
wait 3
expect story pumpkey 1
expect step 11
open Pump hall
wait 3
expect step 12
open Smelter store
wait 3
expect step 15
read Halvard's log 7
expect done